---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";
---

<Base title="About" description="About Andrew Bishop, a software engineer on the west coast of Canada.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Greetings!</p>
    <p>
      I'm a software engineer from the west coast of Canada with experience building products for
      businesses using modern web technologies. I currently work at
      <a href="https://www.treez.io/">Treez</a>, a commerce platform for cannabis retailers, where I
      focus on product development with AWS Serverless (Lambda, API Gateway, EventBridge), Postgres,
      TypeScript and React.
    </p>
    <p>
      I occasionally write <a href="/blog">blog posts</a> about things I'm working on or learning
      about. I also like to tinker on small side projects to try out new technologies. Check out the
      <a href="/projects">projects</a> page, or find all the source code on
      <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
